 "notes": "Exclusion limit derived from chi-squared goodness-of-fit test against NuSTAR cosmic X-ray background (CXB) data (arXiv:2307.11216 Figure 7). The paper computes stellar axion emission spectra and derives limits on the axion-photon coupling by modeling the diffuse stellar axion background (StAB) and its decay to X-rays. The excluded region corresponds to axion parameters where the predicted StAB decay signal would be inconsistent with observed CXB spectrum at 95% confidence level. Axion decay lifetime \u03c4_a is calculated at peak StAB energy (~4.5 keV for m_a \u2264 4.5 keV, ~m_a for m_a > 4.5 keV). Note: This limit overlaps with and is subdominant to existing constraints from globular clusters and relic axion freeze-in (shown in gray in Figure 7), but represents an independent astrophysical constraint from stellar X-ray observations.",
